Scope and other licences

The MIT licence above covers this project's own files: userspace/,
firmware/ and the documentation. Other licences involved:

- driver/: the mt76 Linux driver, including our I/Q additions and changes.
  Licence: BSD-3-Clause-Clear (mt76's licence); see driver/LICENSE and the
  SPDX headers.

- MediaTek firmware (WIFI_RAM_CODE_MT7961_1.bin): not in this repository.
  firmware/ holds only our changes plus checksums, and the patcher modifies
  your own copy. Licence: MediaTek's firmware licence, LICENCE.mediatek in
  linux-firmware.

- SoapySDR, which the Soapy module builds against.
  Licence: Boost Software License 1.0; see the SoapySDR project.

- Nexmon, the framework the firmware patch is built with (the patch build is
  not part of this repository). Licence: Nexmon's licence; see the Nexmon
  project.
